$CATEGORY: Vocabulary/HansenQuinn/3b

::Q001::[markdown]ἐκκλησίᾱ, ἐκκλησίᾱς, ἡ:{
	~%-100%Homer#Incorrect. **Ὅμηρος, Ὁμήρου, ὁ** means “Homer” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%host#Incorrect. **ξένος, ξένου, ὁ** means “host” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%Demothenes (ῥήτωρ)#Incorrect. **Δημοσθένης, Δημοσθένους, ὁ** means “Demothenes (ῥήτωρ)” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%guard#Incorrect. **φυλάττω** is Principal Part 1 of **φυλάττω** “guard” (Chapter 3).
	~%100%assembly#Correct: **ἐκκλησίᾱ, ἐκκλησίᾱς, ἡ** → “assembly” (Chapter 3).
}


::Q002::[markdown]δή:{
	~%-100%at the same time#Incorrect. **ἅμα** means “at the same time” (Chapter 8).
	~%-100%whenever#Incorrect. **ἐπειδάν** means “whenever” (Chapter 11).
	~%100%in fact#Correct: **δή** → “in fact” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%"Oh!", interjection used with vocative#Incorrect. **ὦ** means “"Oh!", interjection used with vocative” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%would that#Incorrect. **εἴθε; εἰ γάρ** means “would that” (Chapter 7).
}


